WEBVTT

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:08.800
Maria Watches Over Us

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:16.140
Spreading a blank map wide open
Shiroi chizu ookiku hiroge

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:23.120
Let's go hide the treasure box
Takara-bako kakushi ni ikou

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:31.190
No need for coats or even hats
Kooto nante iranai boushi mo ne

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:38.860
Armed with just mechanical pencil lead
Shaapen no shin dake haite

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.200
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.170
Running through
kakenukeru

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.110
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:54.070
Our footprints mark the X
ashiato wa batsu-jirushi da yo

00:00:54.520 --> 00:01:01.050
Passing through the walls of the school
Kousha no kabe tsuki-nuke

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:09.360
We can go anywhere, there will be a path there
Dokonimo ikeru soko ni michi ga aru

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:16.560
The pleats of our skirts won't be disturbed
Sukaato no hida midare-nai

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:23.870
If it's a secret journey
Himitsu no tabi nara

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:34.860
Then, it was all...

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.590
...my misunderstanding?

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.100
Yumi-sama...

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:47.990
I don't know what I should do anymore.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.100
Stay there and count to one-hundred.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.640
One. Two. Three.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.050
Four. Five. Six.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:04.110
Seventy-five. Seventy-six.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.580
Seventy-seven. Seventy-eight.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:13.990
Seventy-nine. Eighty. Eighty-one.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.870
Oh, sorry.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.500
I did think that maybe
I shouldn't disturb you, but...

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.470
Noriko!

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.000
Noriko!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.170
What?

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.340
Noriko...

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:38.920
Noriko...

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:41.390
After that,

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:41.790
we parted at the station
without Toko telling me anything.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:42.920
Noriko...
we parted at the station
without Toko telling me anything.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.220
we parted at the station
without Toko telling me anything.

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:50.960
Good morning.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:54.620
Matsudaira

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.740
Good morning, Toko.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.240
Good morning.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.780
Toko, are you participating
in the treasure hunt?

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:10.850
That is nothing you need to worry about, Noriko.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.350
When the new week began,
Toko was back to her usual self.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.990
What in the world is Toko thinking?

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.160
Sponsored by the School Paper
Valentine's Day
Treasure Hunt
Competition of the
Future Lady Roses
What in the world is Toko thinking?

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.360
Sponsored by the School Paper
Valentine's Day
Treasure Hunt
Competition of the
Future Lady Roses

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:27.370
Crisscross

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.370
To Be Held Today
February 14

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.380
Year 3, Pine Class

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.250
Good day, Onee-sama.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.410
Good day, Yumi.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.520
Um...

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:52.330
Oh, wait.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.160
What?

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.620
Let us go somewhere else.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.500
You may not have noticed,

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.600
but my classmates were
watching with great interest.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.840
But seeing us together isn't
a rare sight anymore.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.850
It must be because...

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.420
...they learned that while I declined
every last gift of chocolate last year,

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.550
I made an exception and accepted yours.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.050
They want to see the look on my face when...

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.700
Please show it just to me,

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.130
the look on your face when
you receive chocolates.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.230
I feel like I demanded it.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.140
Not at all.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.730
Thank you.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.740
Oh, my.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.740
Are these...

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.070
...surprising chocolates?

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.310
This is Round Two.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.970
They have a surprising amount of love in them.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:53.980
Then...

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.120
This is from me.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.200
These cannot be chocolates, can they?!

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:05.870
Last year, when you gave me chocolates,

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.230
it made me very happy.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:11.500
So I wanted to return the favor this year.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:13.140
Onee-sama...

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.470
Thank you very much!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.780
Did you make these only for me?

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:21.750
What?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.820
Oh, yes. Only for you.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.380
Since I'm thinking of distancing
myself from Toko-chan for a while.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.450
I see.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.020
There seems to be some sort
of misunderstanding, but...

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.100
I have decided to wait...

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:41.400
...until Toko-chan feels inclined to
speak to me of her own will.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:51.040
What a terrible shame that is,

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.410
when these are so full of love.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.780
P-Pardon me!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:09.830
I'm sorry!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.900
What are you apologizing for?

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.670
I mean, you were exchanging
chocolates, weren't you?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:20.410
We were, but it's not as if there's
a problem with you seeing us.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.080
The way Yumi-sama just reacted,

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.850
it was like a boy in middle school...

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:27.610
...accidentally looking in
on a girl changing clothes.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.490
No, in a sense,

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.180
what I just saw seemed more private
than a girl changing clothes.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.590
It was like they were in a world...

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.490
...that belonged only to the White Rose sisters.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.620
Which means...

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:46.330
If other people saw my dear
sister and me earlier...

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:49.900
Oh, that's so embarrassing!

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.440
Oh, dear, oh dear, oh dear, oh dear!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.870
Yumi-san is...
Oh, dear, oh dear, oh dear, oh dear!

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:54.380
...quite fun to observe, isn't she?

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.410
...quite fun to observe, isn't she?
Oh, so embarrassing!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:55.810
Oh, so embarrassing!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:56.710
She is.
Oh, so embarrassing!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:56.970
Oh, so embarrassing!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:03.740
You're late!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.210
I'm sorry.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:08.390
Well, I'm sure both the White Rose
family and the Red Rose family...

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:14.260
...were quite busy today giving
and receiving chocolates,

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.400
but unfortunately, in the Yellow Rose family,

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.000
the head of the household is away
taking a college entrance exam!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.560
Is Rei-sama not coming?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.930
No idea.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.870
She said something about coming
after her exam was over,

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:26.860
but who knows?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.170
Then, now that everyone's here...

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:31.940
We have the treasure hunt
event after school today!

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.910
Shall we get on with the final meeting?

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.950
Valentine's Day
Treasure Hunt
Competition of the
Future Lady Roses
To Be Held Today

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:54.990
Are you running away?

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.300
I am talking about today's treasure hunt.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.170
Will you be in it or not?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.050
I do not understand what you mean.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.610
Even if I were not to be in it,

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:08.450
I do not think that is cause
to call it "running away."

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.350
Do you think so?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.450
It looks to me like you are
running away from Yumi.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.450
Does the thought of facing Yumi frighten you?

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:19.760
What?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.990
I imagine it does.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.990
Because it frightens me, too.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.690
Because she is so open and honest.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:31.170
She probably has no such intention herself,

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:32.540
but when you are with her,

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.340
it brings you face-to-face with your weaknesses.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:39.810
As if you're being reflected in a mirror,
unclouded and undistorted.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:45.050
Even the things you don't
want to see or admit to.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:49.450
Then why do you stay with her?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.060
Is it not obvious?

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.320
It's because I love her.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:58.570
Being forced to face my
weaknesses is certainly hard,

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:03.070
but not being able to be with
Yumi would be far harder.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:07.070
You see, I have come to hope that if
there are parts of me that I do not like,

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:12.980
I will be able to change those parts,
being reflected in Yumi's mirror.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.210
Why are you telling me this now?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.040
I am no longer...

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.750
I have braced myself, knowing that
Yumi will find a little sister someday.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.660
What kind of girl will her little sister be?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:31.190
Wondering about it has brought
me both joy and sorrow.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:36.540
But if it is a girl that Yumi chooses,
then there can be no mistake.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:39.800
I have believed that and
I would still like to believe it.

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:43.670
But you won't even become my rival.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.880
Even in today's treasure hunt...

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:51.890
I thought that if anyone were to
be my rival, it could only be you,

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:56.190
but if you will not even stand at the
starting line, it cannot be helped.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.890
Please wait!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.630
Oh-ho. There're quite a few
people gathered out there.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.670
Oh, there's Sachiko-sama!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:20.370
And there are Yumi-san fans
gradually closing in on her.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.910
What a shocker!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.520
Toko-chan's here!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.250
What?!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.190
Toko...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.370
We will now begin...

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:44.270
the Treasure Hunt Competition
of the Future Lady Roses!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.780
Red, white, and yellow.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.080
There is one of each card hidden
somewhere within the region...

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.450
...marked by the diagonal lines
on the map we passed out.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.950
The first person to find a card...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.510
...will be awarded the right to a half-day
date with a future Lady Rose.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:05.830
If no one has found one or more of
the cards by the time limit of 4:40,

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.860
the privilege will go to the ladies who entered...

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:10.800
in the Absentee Chance by guessing
the hiding places in advance.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:15.100
Furthermore, Nijyo Noriko-san
has declined to participate...

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.870
...and will be helping out
as a member of the staff.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.410
The Rosa Foetida, Hasekura Rei-sama,

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.380
submitted an Absentee Chance
form the other day.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:26.400
The Rosa Chinensis, who will be participating,

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:31.050
will be given the handicap
of starting 5 minutes later.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:35.490
This year, we also have some
hints scattered here and there,

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.220
so please give it your best at finding them!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:38.920
And now, please start!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.240
Oh, ladies...

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:10.260
You don't need to keep me company
during my handicap, you know.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.760
Are we bothering you?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.620
Not at all, but...

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.930
I know!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.430
How would you like to join me for tea?

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.140
Hey, hey, isn't that a hint?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:32.480
Ku

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.880
Ku
White Rose...

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.180
Ku
What could the "ku" mean?

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.590
There are apparently a total of seven letters...

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.320
...in the hint for Shimako-sama's card.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.590
I heard the letter "ma" was on the
executive committee member board!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.650
Really?

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.170
They're going at it.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:05.710
The hints for the white card are
"ta," " ku," " ma," " shi," " no"?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.150
They weren't all hiragana.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.980
There was a picture of a rabbit, too.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.670
What could it all mean?

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.680
They found another hint!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:18.150
I wonder if somebody's already
found Yoshino's card.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:20.690
I pray...

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.830
...that no one finds it,

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:26.930
and the privilege comes to me among
the Absentee Chance people.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.100
That's...

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.700
Don't tell me...

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.910
Yoshino put it in a place like that?

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:38.410
Rei-sama!
Yoshino put it in a place like that?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.570
Rei-sama!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:42.650
Are you done with today's exam?!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:50.960
Might I have another cup?

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.420
Oh, certainly.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.920
Thank you.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.270
Why is Sachiko-sama drinking
tea in this room forever...

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.970
...instead of looking for the card?!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.200
I don't know.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:13.050
Do you already have an idea of where
Yumi-sama's card is, Rosa Chinensis?

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.010
No.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:17.450
Then, have you given up on looking for it?

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.290
You are both wrong.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.120
After all, I am participating in this event,

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.180
because I want to find Yumi's card.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:28.780
But I have no hope of finding it if
I just search randomly, right?

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.420
That is why I'm waiting here for now.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.400
What are you waiting for?

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:39.570
For the Rosa Chinensis en
bouton to make a mistake.

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.110
Pardon me.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.940
Would it be all right if
I excused myself for just a bit?

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.580
You're worried?

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.240
Go on.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.820
Social Studies Prep Room

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.850
Blank Atlas
of Japan

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:20.650
In grade school, we were given blank,
new maps during social studies...

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:24.880
...and in that moment, I felt incredibly happy.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.920
I'm sorry, but it's not there.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:39.590
So it seems.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:41.870
Blank maps?

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.200
Did something happen...

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.970
...between you and Yumi-sama
that involved blank maps?

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:52.210
Yumi-sama must want you to find the card,

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:55.680
so she must have hidden it in a place
only you two would know about.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.240
Is that what you're thinking?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.190
Are you laughing at how conceited I am?

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.920
That's not it.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.520
You're being too simplistic in
your assessment of Yumi-sama!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:10.000
Yumi-sama cares very much about you,

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:14.300
but she isn't the sort of person
who can see nothing but you!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.640
I realize it now.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.910
Right now,

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.340
it's probably like you're searching for
Yumi-sama in a small room like this.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:26.450
But no matter how you search,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:29.280
you won't find Yumi-sama in a place like this!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:34.610
Yumi-sama is far bigger than you think.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:37.760
So big that she won't even fit in this room.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.920
That's why you can't see it.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:46.090
That's why you can't understand
what's in Yumi-sama's heart!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:49.760
That time...

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:57.140
You wanted to escape this cramped,
suffocating situation.

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:58.650
That's how it seemed to me.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:16:59.580
Was I wrong?!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:05.150
If you stay cooped up in this
cramped place alone forever,

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:06.810
you won't be able to reach Yumi-sama's heart!

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:11.390
At this rate, you'll never be
able to find Yumi-sama's card!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:26.330
You certainly said your fill there.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:31.150
We're friends, after all.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.580
I have to say even the things that
I don't want to say to you.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.920
I have returned.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:50.490
Welcome back.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.030
Was it cold? Your nose is red.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.200
Oh, no. I am fine.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.270
I see.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.540
What about the cards?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.510
None of the cards have been found yet.

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:07.410
Yes, I'm holding off on getting seconds.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:11.120
Yumi-sama, do you think the
red card will be found?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:11.910
Who knows?

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.650
Could someone have finally found one?

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:25.390
Yoshino.

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:27.000
Rei-chan!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.400
W-What's wrong?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.700
It's nothing.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.160
I brought this.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.300
What?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.300
What?!
What?!

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:43.780
Rei-chan, you dummy!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.490
You dummy!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.180
You dumb, dumb, dumb,
dumb, dumb, dumb, dummy!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:47.450
You dummy!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:51.420
Yoshino-san, you don't need to
call her dumb so many times...

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.990
What's wrong with calling a dummy dumb?!

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.050
Show everyone what you brought!

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.030
Pardon me.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:03.670
"Valentine's Chocolate Request Ticket"?!

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:05.570
What?
What?

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.280
Once I get accepted to college,

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:11.140
I'm planning to make a cake
for Yoshino first thing.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.850
And as long as I'm making one,

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.920
I thought I'd ask for her input
and make one incredible cake!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.650
You're trying to get into college!
You don't have to think about such things!

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:22.290
Still, being shown a yellow piece
of paper in this situation,

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.660
it'll make us think it's the treasure hunt card.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:27.290
Oh, if it's the card, I found it.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.060
What?!
What?!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.700
But it'd be bad if someone without
a right to it grabbed it, right?

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.430
I pretended not to see it.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.030
Hi!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.800
Chisato-san! What are you doing here?

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.940
Oh, am I not allowed to be here?

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.910
I have a good reason for it, you know.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.710
Reason?

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:46.410
Yes.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:50.140
I have the yellow card right here!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:01.190
Why did Sachiko-sama choose
her for her little sister?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.030
Too nice.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:04.760
What?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.760
I hate the way that you can
be so indulgent, Yumi-sama!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.440
Let's go to the Drama Club now!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.030
I'll go with you!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.800
There you go again with
that open, vulnerable look.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.350
Toko-chan.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:22.880
Toko-chan.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.820
Toko-chan...

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:34.080
Won't you be my little sister?

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.430
If this is Christmas Eve charity,

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:40.460
please bestow it elsewhere.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.170
Because she is so open and honest.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:50.110
When you are with her, it brings you
face-to-face with your weaknesses.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.170
Why do you stay with her even then?

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.480
Is it not obvious?

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:58.750
It's because I love her.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.760
Because... she loves her...

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.670
Because she loves her...

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:24.910
Social Studies Prep Room

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:36.090
Chisato-san found the yellow
card two years in a row.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:40.450
The white card and the red
card have yet to be found.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.460
Who will find my card?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.530
My dear sister?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:51.900
Or will it be...

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.040
Yumi.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:58.570
Y-Yes?

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:29.640
Yumi-sama!

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.790
A winterscape where even...
Machi no irodori sae doko

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:52.360
...the town's colors seem forlorn somehow
to naku samishige na fuyu no keshiki

00:22:52.730 --> 00:22:56.540
I think of you, turning your back on me...
Senaka mise kaketeitta

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:00.270
...and running off
anata o omou

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:05.280
There's a clear square pane...
Futari no aida ni wa

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.280
...between the two of us
toumei na shikakkei

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:12.020
It's misted over right now...
Ima wa kasunderu

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:18.620
...with the crystals of sighs
tame-iki no kesshou de

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:23.300
Window glass, window glass
Mado garasu mado garasu

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:29.240
It's clouded and I can't see you
Kumottete anata ga mienai no

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:35.140
Even though I know that you're there
Soko ni iru koto wa wakatteiru no ni

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:39.180
Are you smiling? Are you crying?
Waratteru naiteru no

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:45.080
I don't even care if you're frowning, let me see you
Shikamettsura demo ii kara misete

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:53.650
Wipe the glass from your side, too
Sochira no hou kara mo garasu o fuite

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:07.010
