00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:25.060
Preview
But setting those stories aside...

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:26.460
Preview
I wonder what kind of date
Yumi-san and Toko-chan had.

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:28.330
Preview
I wonder what kind of date
